      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rollback Triggers and Actions\nTrigger: elevated 5xx, DC timeout spikes, partial-rate breach, policy misconfiguration\nAction 1: disable remote_forward and aggregate_read flags\nAction 2: retain local path + existing cutover controls\nAction 3: keep observability and capture request_id/DC error evidence",
